# Loop SCREENSHOTS. The review loops write a still per round per view, and
# 175 of them had been committed: 77 MB of the repository's 79 MB of .loop,
# and 77 MB of every clone forever, for pictures whose only readers were the
# round that took them. Nothing in src, scripts, configs or gates.config.json
# cites one. The loops' RECORDS stay tracked and are the point: the disputes,
# the handovers, the state, the probe JSON, and .loop/evidence, which
# src/game/track.js and src/render/scene.js cite as the provenance for
# numbers that are in the code.
.loop/**/*.png
